{"sourceUrl":"https://cnet.bit.edu.cn/tzgg/4781d136e475412890be85134d69fa85.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:47.376956+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cnet.bit.edu.cn/tzgg/4781d136e475412890be85134d69fa85.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>诚挚邀请各位优秀本科生加入北京理工大学空天网络信息技术研究所（以下简称：空天网信所）团队。空天网信所依托北京理工大学网络空间安全学院、信息与电子学院而建，是双学院交叉融合、多学科融合互补的大型综合科研团队。</span></p>\n<p><span>以下为空天网信所</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免研究生面试考核工作安排：</span></p>\n<p><span>一、招生情况</span></p>\n<p><span>空天网信所同时在</span><span>网络空间安全学院、信息与电子学院</span><span>招生，招生专业情况如下表：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>一级学科</span></p><p><span>（代码）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>类型</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>方向</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>网络空间安全学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>网络空间安全</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>083900</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>学术</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>03</span><span>空天智能网络通信及安全、</span><span>04</span><span>智能信息安全与对抗</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>网络与信息安全</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>085412</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>03</span><span>空天智能网络通信及安全、</span><span>04</span><span>智能信息安全与对抗</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>信息与电子学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>信息与通信工程</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>081000</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>学术</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>085401</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>专业</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>085402</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span>二、报名链接</span></p>\n<p><span>信息与电子学院</span><span>预报名时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日 </span><span>12</span><span>：</span><span>00 —2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日 </span><span>24</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span> </span><span>，报名链接：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.wjx.top/vm/tqMTPTF.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/tqMTPTF.aspx</span><span></span></a></p>\n<p><span>网络空间安全学院</span><span>预报名时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span><span>12</span><span>：</span><span>00—2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日 </span><span>17</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>，报名链接：</span></p>\n<p><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/PioxGV7.aspx#</span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>注：每位同学在两个学院均可报名</span><span>。</span><span>研究所拟结合导师数量、保研名额及报名人数等统筹安排复试，请同学们在报名时尽量选好想去的学院。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、资料提交</span></p>\n<p><span>报名参加面试的同学需满足北京理工大学招收免试研究生的基本条件，材料提交请参考两个学院发布的招生方案</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）北京理工大学信息与电子学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）方案：</span><span>https://sie.bit.edu.cn/tzgg/zhtz/5968f1c2826449d4a15a4891dd218c03.htm</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）北京理工大学网络空间安全学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）方案：</span><span>https://cst.bit.edu.cn/xxfw/tzgg/58a147115f154c439a0851311c8fc0d0.htm</span></p>\n<p><span>四、面试考核</span></p>\n<p><span>面试考核具体时间以复试秘书通知为主。面试考核内容包括但不仅限于专业课知识、项目经验、人文背景及心理测试等，以两个学院发布的招生方案为准。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"95db89773f9ef6cb1b7ddfd9d518d770621b2636368eccda6614f6c7c0e48c1b","textLength":934,"sourceSha256":"bf6c393125cddc225fade0d495bc57919101c1a7a75942e5334631b5712b54c7","selector":"article-like:article","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d534069d5ff411ce8625","title":"2026年北京理工大学空天网络信息技术研究所关于2027年接收优秀毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:47.376956+00:00"}
